# 标准 96 孔板细胞活性检测示例（AsterML v2）

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-canonical-cck8
schema: 1
title: 96孔板细胞药物活性测试示例
objective: 验证药物浓度梯度对贴壁细胞存活率的影响
experimental_unit: 独立培养孔
timepoints: [24h]
primary_endpoint: OD450
endpoint_method: 酶标仪吸光度
endpoint_unit: AU
```

```asterlab
kind: group_table
id: gt-main
schema: 1
title: 实验分组
rows:
  - {id: g_ctrl, name: 对照组, role: control, condition: 0.1% DMSO, independent_n: 3}
  - {id: g_treat, name: 给药组, role: treatment, condition: 10 uM Drug, independent_n: 3}
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-od450
schema: 1
title: CCK-8 活性检测
endpoint: OD450
method: 微孔板吸光度测定
unit: AU
group_refs: [g_ctrl, g_treat]
control_group_ref: g_ctrl
timepoints: [24h]
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: plate-96-main
schema: 1
title: 96孔细胞处理板
format: 96
topology: plate
assay: assay-od450
timepoint: 24h
groups:
  g_ctrl: [B2, B3, B4]
  g_treat: [C2, C3, C4]
samples:
  B2: smp-c1
  B3: smp-c2
  B4: smp-c3
  C2: smp-t1
  C3: smp-t2
  C4: smp-t3
replicates:
  B2: 1
  B3: 1
  B4: 1
  C2: 1
  C3: 1
  C4: 1
roles:
  B2: vehicle
  B3: vehicle
  B4: vehicle
  C2: sample
  C3: sample
  C4: sample
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-01-treat
schema: 1
title: 01 配液加药与测定
execution: executable
assay: assay-od450
timepoints: [24h]
block_refs: [plate-96-main]
blocks:
  - kind: param_table
    id: pt-treat
    schema: 1
    title: 关键条件
    rows:
      - {key: seed_density, label: 接种密度, value: 5000, unit: "1"}
      - {key: cck8_vol, label: CCK-8单孔体积, value: 10, unit: uL}
  - kind: calculator
    id: calc-mix
    schema: 1
    title: 配液余量计算
    mode: group_mastermix
    volume_per_unit: {value: 100, unit: uL}
    excess_ratio: 0.15
    plate_ref: plate-96-main
    sample_count: 6
  - kind: timer
    id: tm-cck8
    schema: 1
    title: CCK-8 显色孵育
    mode: countdown
    duration: {value: 2, unit: h}
  - kind: checklist
    id: chk-treat
    schema: 1
    items:
      - {id: chk-bubble, label: 确认加样后孔内无明显气泡, blocking: true}
  - kind: data_table
    id: dt-od450
    schema: 1
    title: OD450 原始读数
    endpoint: OD450
    bind_groups: true
    container_ref: plate-96-main
    layout: rows
    columns:
      - {key: well, label: 孔位, value_kind: text}
      - {key: od450, label: OD450, value_kind: number, unit: AU, min: 0, max: 4}
```
